### Переменные окружения
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8092
@statementId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

### 3. Расчет предложений (успешный сценарий)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculator/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500000,
  "term": 12,
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "middleName": "Ivanovich",
  "email": "ivan@mail.com",
  "birthdate": "1990-01-01",
  "passportSeries": "1234",
  "passportNumber": "123456"
}

### 4. Расчет предложений (без отчества - опционально)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculator/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 300000,
  "term": 24,
  "firstName": "Petr",
  "lastName": "Petrov",
  "email": "petr@mail.com",
  "birthdate": "1985-05-15",
  "passportSeries": "5678",
  "passportNumber": "901234"
}

